HookMod_MM.dll -- HookMod (reconstructed), a Metamod grappling-hook plugin for The Specialists on H9XASH.

NOT a patch of an upstream binary. The original "Hook Mod v5" (Drunken_F00l / Tony Paloma,
adminop.net) was abandoned, Windows-only; it was reverse-engineered from the shipped HookMod_MM.dll
into clean C++ at EntMod4/src/HookMod/. Metamod-only (the standalone shim was dropped). The Linux
HookMod_i386.so is NEW -- none shipped originally.

Build:
  Windows:  MSBuild EntMod4/src/HookMod/msvc/HookMod.vcxproj /p:Configuration=Release;Platform=Win32;PlatformToolset=v143  -> EntMod4/dist/HookMod_MM.dll
  Linux:    make -C EntMod4/src/HookMod  -> HookMod_i386.so

HAVOC9 additions (src/HookMod/h9_gate.cpp): the same entmod / entmod_maps gate as EntMod -- on when
the map name contains "entmap", the map is in the entmod_maps list, or "entmod 1"; inert otherwise.
The decision is printed to the server console each map ("[HookMod] map '<name>' -> hook ON/off").
DF_hook_on is the mod's own master switch.
